---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About AppScoutHub"
  description="Learn how AppScoutHub tests and reviews AI software, and why our reviews focus on honesty over hype."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">About AppScoutHub</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-6 max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
      <p>
        AppScoutHub is an independent publication dedicated to honest, hands-on reviews of AI tools and software.
        New AI products launch every week, and it's become nearly impossible to know which ones are actually worth
        your time and money — that's the gap we're trying to fill.
      </p>
      <h2>How we review</h2>
      <p>
        Every tool featured on this site is used directly for real tasks — writing, coding, generating images, or
        managing projects — before we publish a review. We evaluate:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Core feature quality and reliability</li>
        <li>Ease of use and learning curve</li>
        <li>Pricing versus value delivered</li>
        <li>How it compares to close competitors</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site may be affiliate links, which means we may earn a commission if you sign up through
        them — at no extra cost to you. This never affects our ratings or opinions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
